graph TB
    subgraph Client["🌐 Client Layer"]
        Browser["User Browser"]
        UI["React Frontend<br/>http://localhost:5173<br/><br/>- DetectionInterface<br/>- Upload Component<br/>- Results Display<br/>- Confidence Slider"]
        Browser -->|Renders| UI
    end

    subgraph UserInteraction["📤 User Input"]
        Upload["📤 Upload Image<br/>- Drag & Drop<br/>- File Selection"]
        Webcam["📹 Webcam Capture<br/>- Real-time Feed<br/>- Capture Button"]
        Threshold["⚙️ Confidence Threshold<br/>Slider Control"]
    end

    UI -->|User Actions| Upload
    UI -->|User Actions| Webcam
    UI -->|Configuration| Threshold

    subgraph Network["🌍 Network"]
        HTTP["HTTP POST /detect-image<br/>JSON: image + confidence"]
    end

    Upload -->|Submit| HTTP
    Webcam -->|Submit| HTTP

    subgraph Backend["⚙️ Backend Layer"]
        Flask["Flask App<br/>http://localhost:5000<br/><br/>- CORS Enabled<br/>- Max File: 16MB<br/>- Model: Pre-loaded"]
        
        Router["routes/detect.py<br/>REST API Endpoints<br/><br/>- GET /health<br/>- POST /detect-image<br/>- GET /classes<br/>- GET /model-info"]
        
        YOLOService["services/yolo_service.py<br/>YOLOService Class<br/><br/>- Load YOLOv8 Model<br/>- Run Inference<br/>- Parse Results<br/>- Extract Bounding Boxes<br/>- Map Class IDs"]
        
        ImageUtils["utils/image_utils.py<br/>Image Processing<br/><br/>- save_uploaded_file<br/>- draw_detections<br/>- image_to_base64<br/>- get_dimensions"]
    end

    HTTP -->|Route Request| Flask
    Flask -->|Processes| Router
    Router -->|Calls| YOLOService
    YOLOService -->|Processes| ImageUtils

    subgraph ML["🤖 ML Model Layer"]
        Model["YOLOv8 Model<br/>trained-model/weights/<br/><br/>- best.pt<br/>- last.pt"]
        Classes["Class Labels<br/>- Fire Extinguisher<br/>- First Aid Kit<br/>- Caution Sign<br/>- etc."]
    end

    YOLOService -->|Loads| Model
    Model -->|Uses| Classes

    subgraph Storage["💾 Storage"]
        Uploads["uploads/<br/>Temporary Image Files"]
        Results["Detection Results<br/>- Annotated Image<br/>- Detections JSON<br/>- Confidence Scores"]
    end

    ImageUtils -->|Saves| Uploads
    ImageUtils -->|Generates| Results

    subgraph Response["📥 Response Flow"]
        JSON["JSON Response<br/><br/>- annotated_image_base64<br/>- detections[]<br/>- class_name<br/>- confidence<br/>- bbox coordinates"]
    end

    Results -->|Serialize| JSON
    JSON -->|HTTP 200| UI

    subgraph Display["📊 Results Display"]
        Display1["Annotated Image<br/>with Bounding Boxes"]
        Display2["Detection List<br/>Objects Found<br/>Confidence %<br/>Coordinates"]
        Display3["Download Button<br/>Export Results"]
    end

    UI -->|Render| Display1
    UI -->|Show| Display2
    UI -->|Enable| Display3

    style Client fill:#e1f5ff
    style Backend fill:#f3e5f5
    style ML fill:#fff3e0
    style Storage fill:#e8f5e9
    style Response fill:#fce4ec
    style Display fill:#e0f2f1
